### 3. `main.gdshader` (Reconstruct True Space)
We will read the pure distance, shoot a ray from the Godot camera, and map the depth perfectly to Godot's Z-buffer. We will also manually "un-flip" the X and Y coordinates of the normals.

Replace your entire **`main.gdshader`** with this:

```glsl
