If we look at your actual `splat_cloud_data.gd`, the `DEFAULT_PROPERTIES` array has **62 elements** (including all 45 `f_rest` spherical harmonics)[cite: 16]. Because the previous importer was hardcoded for the 19-element array, it shoved your opacity and scale data right into the `f_rest` slots and left the actual Opacity/Scale slots sitting at `0.0`. Since Opacity and Scale were 0, the splats were invisible!

